まずはグッズから！ First up, the merch!
First off, the merch!

767
01:02:15,897 --> 01:02:20,397
We have the Acrylic Diorama StandRyS illustrated by Inuno Niske-sensei,

768
01:02:20,397 --> 01:02:23,397
the ChibiRyS Tote Bag illustrated by Lian-sensei,

769
01:02:23,397 --> 01:02:28,397
the Race QueenRyS Keychain, which is a really cute race queen plushie keychain,

770
01:02:28,397 --> 01:02:31,197
and the YabaiRyS Pouch!

771
01:02:31,197 --> 01:02:34,197
For full set bonuses, the limited edition includes a postcard

772
01:02:34,197 --> 01:02:37,397
with a handwritten message and a foil-stamped autograph.

773
01:02:37,397 --> 01:02:41,397
The standard version includes a postcard with both a foil-stamped message and autograph.

774
01:02:41,397 --> 01:02:48,197
And sales will start at 1:15 PM, which is like real soon if not maybe even now.

775
01:02:48,197 --> 01:02:50,197
フルセットを買っていただいた方には
For those who purchase the full set,

776
01:02:50,197 --> 01:02:55,897
数量限定版は直筆メッセージ＆箔押し複製サイン入りポストカードがついてきます。
the limited edition comes with a postcard featuring a handwritten message and foil-stamped signature copy.

777
01:02:55,897 --> 01:03:00,397
通常バージョンは箔押し複製サイン＆メッセージ入りポストカードになります。
The standard version comes with a postcard featuring a foil-stamped signature copy and message.

778
01:03:00,397 --> 01:03:03,397
この後1時15分にカートオープンするよ！
The cart will open after this at 1:15!

779
01:03:03,397 --> 01:03:05,397
もうすぐだよ！
It's coming up very soon!

780
01:03:05,397 --> 01:03:07,897
続いてアルバムです！ Next up, the album!
Next up, the album!

781
01:03:07,897 --> 01:03:10,397
This time it's being released in two formats:

782
01:03:10,397 --> 01:03:13,597
the CD and vinyl! Woo-hoo!

783
01:03:13,597 --> 01:03:18,897
Pre-orders will begin also at 1:15 PM JST at the hololive production official shop, like real soon.

784
01:03:18,897 --> 01:03:24,397
As for digital releases, that will happen on July 12th!

785
01:03:24,397 --> 01:03:27,897
今回はCDとレコードの2種類のリリースとなっておりまして、
This time, it's being released in two formats: CD and vinyl record,

786
01:03:27,897 --> 01:03:33,897
この後1時15分よりホロライブオフィシャルショップにて予約が開始されます！
and pre-orders will begin on the hololive official shop starting at 1:15!

787
01:03:33,897 --> 01:03:37,397
デジタルリリースは7月12日です！
The digital release is July 12th!

788
01:03:37,397 --> 01:03:42,897
CDにはここでしか聴けない「Gravity」のリアレンジバージョンとステッカー2種類、
The CD includes a rearranged version of "Gravity" available only here, plus 2 types of stickers,

789
01:03:42,897 --> 01:03:50,397
レコードにはジャケットとアナザージャケットが印刷されたLPサイズ両面ポスターカードがついてきます。
while the vinyl record comes with an LP-sized double-sided poster card featuring both the jacket and alternate jacket art.

790
01:03:50,397 --> 01:03:53,397
ポストカードじゃないよ、ポスターカード！
It's not a "postcard", it's a poster card!

791
01:03:53,397 --> 01:03:55,397
もっとでかいです！
It's much bigger!

792
01:03:55,397 --> 01:03:59,897
さらにこちらのポスターカードには両面のどちらかに必ず直筆サインが入ります！
Furthermore, on one side of this poster card, there will definitely be a handwritten signature!

793
01:03:59,897 --> 01:04:02,397
サインされる面はランダムでございます！
The signed side will be random!

794
01:04:02,397 --> 01:04:06,197
裏面かもしれないし、表面かもしれないです。
It might be on the back, or it might be on the front.

795
01:04:06,197 --> 01:04:11,397
The CD will include an exclusive rearranged version of "Gravity" and two types of stickers,

796
01:04:11,397 --> 01:04:16,397
while the vinyl comes with a double-sided LP-sized poster card.

797
01:04:16,397 --> 01:04:21,397
Yes, a pretty darn big poster card, featuring both the main and alternate album covers.

798
01:04:21,397 --> 01:04:24,397
Plus—yes, a big plus—

799
01:04:24,397 --> 01:04:28,397
one side of this poster card will definitely feature a handwritten autograph!

800
01:04:28,397 --> 01:04:33,897
The signed side will be random, so it could be on either the alternate jacket side or the main album cover!

801
01:04:33,897 --> 01:04:36,897
We'll see when you get it!

802
01:04:36,897 --> 01:04:44,897
And "Be My Flame", which was performed in today's 3D Live, will also be digitally released at midnight today! So don't forget to check it out!

803
01:04:44,897 --> 01:04:52,397
そしてライブでお披露目した「Be My Flame」は24時にデジタルリリースもあるので、忘れずにチェックしてね！
And "Be My Flame", which was premiered during the live, will also be digitally released at midnight, so make sure to check it out!

804
01:04:52,397 --> 01:04:55,897
And there's more! That's right!

805
01:04:55,897 --> 01:04:59,397
My first solo live concert! Woo-hoo!

806
01:05:00,252 --> 01:05:04,152
Tokyo at SGC Hall Ariake, woo!

807
01:05:04,152 --> 01:05:08,052
And it will be held on a Tuesday on October 6th.

808
01:05:08,052 --> 01:05:12,052
I'm super super duper excited for this,

809
01:05:12,052 --> 01:05:14,552
and I'm so glad I got to finally announce it!

810
01:05:14,552 --> 01:05:18,252
So I hope you guys will be really excited for it as well! Yay!

811
01:05:18,252 --> 01:05:21,152
あとね、ソロライブも決まりました！
Also, my solo live concert has been confirmed!

812
01:05:21,152 --> 01:05:25,052
場所は東京SGCホール有明でございます！
The venue will be SGC Hall Ariake in Tokyo!

813
01:05:25,052 --> 01:05:30,052
えーっと、開催される日程は10月6日火曜日です！
Um, the date it will be held is Tuesday, October 6th!

814
01:05:30,052 --> 01:05:32,552
すっごく楽しみにしてるし、
I'm really looking forward to it,

815
01:05:32,552 --> 01:05:38,452
もうとにかく、もうこんなライブがやれる機会自体が本当にまさかできると思ってなくて、
and anyways, I never thought I'd get the chance to hold a concert like this,

816
01:05:38,452 --> 01:05:43,052
とってもワクワクしてますし、これからも準備頑張ります！
so I'm super excited, and I'll keep doing my best to prepare!

817
01:05:43,052 --> 01:05:48,552
Please look forward to further details and information in the future!

818
01:05:48,552 --> 01:05:53,152
Last but not least, there will be a members-only part starting at 1:30 PM

819
01:05:53,152 --> 01:05:58,052
pretty soon, so please come check it out if you can and join the family!

820
01:05:58,052 --> 01:06:04,452
最後に、メン限定パートが1時半から始まるので、良かったらメンバーに入って見に来てね！
Lastly, the members-only stream starts at 1:30, so if you'd like, join as a member and come watch!

821
01:06:04,452 --> 01:06:08,052
では、ありがとうございました！
Well then, thank you so much!

822
01:06:08,052 --> 01:06:13,452
Thank you very much! Bye-ryS for now, until the members part!

